  "components": [
    {
      "name": "BubbleChart",
      "support": {
        "status": "beta",
        "notes": "Cartesian chart drawn on a `<canvas type=\"2d\">` by the DOM-free engine: the web component props mapped to the same presets and engine options, tap / scrub tooltip, legend toggles, pinch zoom, pan and double-tap reset; hover/pointClick/plotClick/zoom events and a template ref handle (resetZoom/getView/setView/getInstance/resize). No WebGPU / WebGL renderer and no keyboard navigation; tooltip.render may only return text. Component tests, H5 tests in happy-dom and the official uni-app WeChat SDK compilation fixture pass. Physical-device E2E and other native targets are not verified."
      },
      "api": {
        "status": "beta",
